WEBVTT

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.080
Wait...

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.690
Wait!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.670
Mama!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.130
Jululu!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.160
Jululu!

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:29.930
Mama!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.470
Mama!

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.840
H–Hey, what's wrong?

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.320
What's wrong, Jululu?

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:45.810
Did you have a bad dream?

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.060
Mama...

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.050
Good morning, Non!

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.060
Morning!

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.970
Here you go.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.120
No!

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.960
A... ah...

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.940
Are you saying you want me to feed it to you?

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.790
All righty, then.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.900
Here, peach yoghurt. Say "ah".

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:16.030
Is it yummy, Jululu?

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:17.850
That's great.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.440
Ma... Mama.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:20.050
La...

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.460
Mama... la...

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.270
La... la...

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:28.770
Huh? Mama lays eggs?

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.880
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:35.890
As you recall, through the grace of the goddess Jewlie,

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.950
a Last-Chance Rematch Tournament will be held!

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:42.280
To all idols who received a Mystery Rare coord,

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.220
entries begin today!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.180
Jululu, it's time to head out.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.640
Go on into the Rosette Pact.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:28.200
You don't want to?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.560
La... laa...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.690
Okay, then.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.960
Mama!

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:39.820
You're really Little Miss Fussy today, aren't you?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:48.830
One more space remains in the Divine Idol Grand Prix final.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.230
Which team will claim it?

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.830
The Last-Chance Rematch Tournament is hotting up!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.360
All the teams look pri tough.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.830
Say, that reminds me...

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:01.600
Onee-sama said she was concerned about entering.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.260
Pri?

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.340
Let's go see her!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.380
Hey, there she is!

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.510
Cosmo-san! Ajimi-sensei!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.340
I'm tearing my hair-onymus Bosch out!
I'm cosmically worried!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.740
Wh–What on earth happened-pri?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.760
Well, you see...

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.080
After our last performance,
when Nanami-chan went "Kyupikon!"

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.690
and blasted off into space,
she hasn't been seen since!

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:24.740
What?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.000
If Nanami doesn't come back, we can't enter-aser!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.240
We're in a pinch-Da Vinci!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.700
If you want to know where Nanami-chan is...

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:36.550
you could ask her Pink Actress teammates who accom-pri her.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.640
Actually, it's funny you should mention them.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.930
Pink Actress has currently suspended their activities!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:42.800
What?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:48.450
It seems Miss Sakura and Miss Momo are fighting over the same senior boy!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.560
It's all-out war!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.720
What?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.890
That's why we let Nanami-chan into <i>our</i> team, but...

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.610
It's a de La Tour-icate situation!

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.340
If we don't have enough member-andts, we Caravaggio-n't compete!

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.900
That would be unbear-ubens! Un-Jan van Eyck-cceptable!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.490
Worst comes to worst, you can always form a new team!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:06.500
Really? You can do that-pri?
Really? You can do that?
Worst comes to worst, you can always form a new team!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.440
Really? You can do that?
Really? You can do that-pri?

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:14.360
Certainly. If you manage to find a new member,
please do enter the Last-Chance Rematch Tournament!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.040
Cosmically loud and clear!

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.920
Loud and clear-Da Vinci!

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.370
Mama... Mama...

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:21.950
What's wrong, Jululu?

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.520
Ho... sey...

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.880
What? Do you want to play horsey?

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:30.850
Ho-sey!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.730
Boo-hoo...
Ho-sey!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:32.310
Boo-hoo...

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.770
Cosmo-san and Ajimi-sensei are looking for a new member?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.340
Those two...

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:39.440
Those two are too intense –
if you joined their team,

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.800
you'd lose all hope of getting the spotlight.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.840
You may be right...

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.480
Pri.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.700
I hope they find someone willing to join.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.720
The poorest shot will hit the target if she shoots often enough-pri!

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.500
Let's s-pri-t up and search!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.300
Yeah!

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.040
We're counting on you, too, Lala-pri!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:54.790
Huh?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.000
Okay, we'll get going as well.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.420
Mama! Mama...

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.960
What, again?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.280
Roll, roll!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.890
Do you want to play with the ball now?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.310
Capisce...

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.490
Here it comes, rolling your way!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.860
And here it comes...

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.490
This feels more like fetch...

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.970
Are you tuckered out after playing, Jululu?

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:41.820
Why don't you go in the Rosette Pact?

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.500
There we go.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.050
Not going in, huh...

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:57.380
Who would have thought
a sleeping baby would be this heavy?

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.290
Hey!

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.650
It's Super Celebrity Three!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.110
I'm Padonna.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.570
Puitney. And you must be...

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.030
Little Jululu, right? I'm Panet.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.490
What a lovely little babe!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.700
She's so cute! I want to hug her!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.030
Me too!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.450
C–Capisce!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.240
Oh my god.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:24.880
She'll be fine now.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.610
I guess it's gotta be Mum.

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.670
Bye-bye, little baby.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:36.520
Puitting the scene.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.390
Oh, right – um...

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.060
Hm?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.770
Would any of you like to join this team?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.790
Oh...

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.730
No, thank you.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:47.980
Not together with them.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.570
Very, very impossible.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.180
I guess not.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.530
I hope I can find someone else...

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.810
Hey, yeah! They seem to pick up
new members every time you see them.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.070
I'm sure one...

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.170
Yeah, no.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.930
I have a duty to protect PriPara.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.340
Now, goat.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.770
Take me to Onee-sama!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:25.650
Onward, I say, not downward!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.030
Don't sleep! Heed my commands!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:34.390
You've been chosen by a goddess, goat –
feel a sense of divine purpose already!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.180
For Heaven's sake.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.070
Ignorant beast.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.830
I found Janice!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:44.880
Pepper!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.460
Pepper!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.250
She found her?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.880
Why don't you just come home already?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.330
Abandoning your team is a violation of the rules.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.600
Why are you in such a place?

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:05.280
We wanted to make sure your
Rosette Pact hadn't fallen in the river or such,

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.610
so the three of us split up to search for you.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.520
Your concern is unwarranted!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:13.070
Don't say that! Chiri has flower arrangemen
practice every day, you know!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.450
You should be focusing on the upcoming final!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.710
You don't have time for such trivialities.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:19.470
So why are you–

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:21.830
Because we're worried about you, obviously.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.650
Hey, that's right!

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.760
I thought we could all eat this together.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.720
So cold! Tasty!

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:41.660
It's so good!

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:44.730
Even if it's winter outside,
cold food is great in PriPara!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.230
And you too, Janice.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.150
I will refrain, thank you.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.610
I know you'll like it.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.520
I will be fine, I said.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.780
It's peach-flavoured, no? It's delicious!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.320
I thought so!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.750
I figured you'd like the same things as Jewlie, since you're twins.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.210
The cool sensation is wonderful, isn't it?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.720
Didn't I tell you? Now come on,
eat as much as you like.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.880
Here you go.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.840
That won't do! Chiri, you haven't had any yet!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.140
I will have my share later.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.490
That won't do. Chiri, eat it now!

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.110
Pepper's eyeing it, you know.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:28.440
But...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.410
Hurry up – I command you!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.220
If you insist.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.080
Oh, it <i>is</i> delicious!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.600
Chiri, give one bite!

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:36.740
Very well.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:37.620
You're okay with her using your spoon?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.300
<i>This team really has grown wonderfully in this short period.</i>

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.170
Well, I'm sure Pepper's brushing her teeth properly...

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:42.970
<i>If possible, I'd like to watch over
your growth in the future as well.</i>

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.790
Not since tasting Usacha!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.620
This from Sapanna! Bleh!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.620
<i>But...</i>

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:53.710
As you're all well aware,
I have an important mission to attend to.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.460
If you'll excuse me.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.010
Janice!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:15.860
Oh, Jululu...

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.530
You really don't want to go inside the compact, do you?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:22.160
And you cry if I put you in the stroller...

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:25.570
Won't you go inside the Rosette Pact for me?

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.960
Oh, I've had it! You're too darn needy today!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.500
Hello there, Jululu! It's Mama's Mama!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.030
Mum!

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.350
Ran-ny!

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.350
Gra–

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:44.230
That's not right, Jululu. I'm Mama's Mama.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.050
Oh, it's only a baby's prattling...

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:47.770
Ran-ny!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.920
G–G–Granny...

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:55.810
Did you enter the Last-Chance Rematch Tournament?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:56.700
Nope.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:57.480
Huh?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:01.200
Performing after all this time made me realise.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:08.000
Rather than becoming a Divine Idol myself,
I want to cheer on my daughters.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.350
That's what makes me happy.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.370
That goes for me as well.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:16.000
I want to encourage my beloved students as you chase your dreams-glo.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.210
Encourage-puru!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:21.510
Mum... Principal Ookanda... thank you.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:23.220
Huh? Doesn't that mean...

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.680
Rina-chan's available?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.640
All hope-ierre-Auguste Renoir is lost!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.440
We couldn't Degas-cover a new member at all!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.450
This is a dark matter of cosmic urgency!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.600
Cosmo-san! Ajimi-sensei!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.060
I found you a new member!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:39.600
This is Rina-chan!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.420
Ooh!

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.990
Rina-chan!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.340
You've De Chiri-come to rescue us!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:45.940
Now you're here, I'm over the Munch!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.380
We'll wrap this up with a win – done and Ken Done!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.450
Wait just a minute-glo!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.910
Glo-chan!

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.540
Rina-chan!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:53.870
Glo-chan!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:54.870
Oh, who's a good girl?

00:12:56.010 --> 00:13:01.050
Rina-chan and I are like mother and daughter! We can't be so easily separated-glo!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.840
It's just like you and Jululu.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.670
Ah!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:05.720
Mama!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.230
I see.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:10.070
I'm sorry I took you away like that, Rina-chan.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.560
It's fine-puru!

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.120
Hello, everyone.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.320
We found a new member!

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:18.900
Pri!

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.730
Sophie's Royal Guard?

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:25.250
Don't dilly-Dalí! Hurry up and tell us which of you is joining our team-Da Vinci?

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:30.820
Allow me to introduce her! She's a unique individual
who can stand alongside you, Ajimi-sensei and Cosmo-san!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:35.170
The invincible powerful girl,
pride of Lady Sophie's Royal Guards:

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.760
and her name...

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:47.620
Chanko!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.760
Chanko-chan?

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:53.680
Well, I'm sure you're in the
elite class and you'd be a valuable asset,

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.100
But weren't you already in a team?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.980
Well, sure, performing was fun.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:07.530
But we realised anew that seeing Lady Sophie shine
and cheering her on is even more fun!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.860
Mm-hm.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.120
Please look after our Chanko!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.370
Please look after me-chanko.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.540
Cosmically looking forward to it!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.830
I can-Knopf wait! Cranach wait! This is gonna be g-Rubens!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.540
We're Ucchari Big Bangs!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.290
Da Vinci!
Chanko!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.040
Isn't that wonderful, Onee-sama?

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.050
Mama!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.640
Aw, sorry, Jululu.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:30.050
Jululu's been really clingy to you today, Lala-pri.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:30.960
I wonder why?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.810
Mama... la... la...

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:37.730
Jululu's getting better and better at pri-nouncing words.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:41.190
Maybe there's something she wants to tell Lala.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.150
She wants to tell me something?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:46.610
La.. la!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:55.540
The Divine Idol Grand Prix Last-Chance Rematch Tournament will be held momentarily.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.370
Our entries are these four teams!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.540
Each entrant brings unrivalled uniqueness!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:01.560
I wonder which of them will
make it through to the main event?
Each entrant brings unrivalled uniqueness!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.460
I wonder which of them will
make it through to the main event?

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.390
You can't tear your eyes away!

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:09.480
I must attain the baton, no matter what!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.840
Y to the A-Y!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.800
Hey! Come on!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.760
Thank you!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.380
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.710
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.710
Starting the Coord Change.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:55.360
They're appearing in a super-rare Mystery Coord,
with a stark black-and-white pattern!

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:57.250
Mystery Rare Coord!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.390
Chanko!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.040
Cosmic!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:15:59.730
Da Vinci!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:05.890
Cosmic!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.070
Dosukoi-chanko!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.400
Da Vinci!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.580
Ucchari Big Bangs!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.280
Cosmic!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.320
Cosmic!
